  <rules>
    <rule name="Decapitation Strike" id="9f16-4a8d-6e59-d144" hidden="false">
      <description>At the start of the first battle round, roll 1d6. On a 5+, you must select one Character from your opponent’s army to be your Priority Target. Otherwise, your opponent must select one Character from their army to be your Priority Target.


Each time a Raven Guard model makes an attack that targets your Priority Target&apos;s unit, you can re-roll Hit rolls of 1.


Each time your Priority Target is destroyed, you gain 1CP and you immediately roll 1d6, adding 1 for each Priority Target that has been destroyed. On a 5+, select another Character unit from their army to be your new Priority Target. Otherwise, your opponent must select one Character from their army to be your Priority Target.


You cannot gain more than 3CP per battle from this ability.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Guardians of Lelithar" id="1db7-2def-e290-d6c8" hidden="false">
      <description>Before a game, select either Hammers of Caliban or Calibanite Jaegers as your Primary Army.

• If your primary army is Hammers of Caliban, when adding a Faction: Hammers of Caliban unit to your order of battle, it must select an Order of the Hexagrammon. Some units must join a specific order, listed below.
o All models in a unit must be of the same Order of the Hexagrammon.


• If your primary army is Calibanite Jaegers, models with the Faction: Calibanite Jaeger keyword gain the Solar Auxilia army rule. Additionally, you may select one Order of the Hexagrammon. Any Faction: Hammers of Caliban models including in your order of battle must belong to that Order of the Hexagrammon. If a model cannot be part of that Order of the Hexagrammon, it cannot be included.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Solar Auxillia" id="e02c-3538-2c94-4574" hidden="false">
      <description>Models with the Faction: Calibanite Jaegers Keyword gain the following benefits:


Loyal Companions: While within 6” of a unit with the Faction: Hammers of Caliban Keyword, models in this unit gain +1 Leadership.


Dutiful Guardians: While not within 6” of a unit with the Faction: Hammers of Caliban Keyword, gain +1 OC.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Orders of the Hexagrammon" id="43bb-bf5c-b168-95f3" hidden="false">
      <description>Deathwing – Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that attack’s Ballistic Skill or Weapon Skill characteristics and/or to the Hit roll.


Dreadwing – Models without the Hammers of Caliban keyword within 6” suffer -1 to Feel No Pain rolls.


Firewing – Models with this Keyword are considered to be 6” closer to the target when making shooting attacks than they actually are.


Ironwing – Reroll wound rolls of 1 against vehicles.
Ravenwing – +2 to Movement


Stormwing - Models with this Keyword gain +1 to Attacks with Bolt Weapons.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
