      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">When this model is attached to a unit, it may be joined by another other number of models with this special rule. If two or more models with this special rule are attached to the same unit, no models with the Support ability may join this unit.</characteristic>
