    <profile name="Rad Grenades" id="313c-6b63-b3b0-2984" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack against an Infantry or Monster unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is less than or equal to the Toughness characteristic of the target, add 1 to the Wound roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Chain Fire" id="208e-c31c-0873-5275" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">If this unit has not been selected to shoot yet, it may choose to use Chain Fire. If it does so, then this model may double the number of attacks it may make with ranged weapons. Before making any shooting attacks with this model using Chain Fire, it must make two hazardous rolls. If the model is destroyed, it may not make any attacks. If the weapon already has Hazardous, before making any shooting attacks the Moritat must make all 3 Hazardous rolls (but does not make the normal hazardous roll after attacking).

A unit with a model that used Chain Fire this turn is not eligible to charge.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Death is my Duty" id="a317-4081-f74e-b0b2" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">This model can never be targeted by a friendly Stratagem</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Expendable" id="13da-0c9f-9cf0-9122" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">This model can never be given Enhancements.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Leader" id="4af9-1f6f-3b57-6eae" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <comment>Moritat</comment>
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">This model can be attached to the following units:
• Destroyer Squad
• Dreadwing Interemptor Squad</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Chainsword Doctrines" id="99a4-1239-b620-b670" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time this unit is selected to fight, if it contains an Assault Sergeant select one of the following abilities to apply to all Chainswords and Heavy Chainswords equipped by models in this unit until the end of the phase:
• Lance
• Lethal Hits
• Sustained Hits 1</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Breach Discipline" id="8e68-83db-13da-04aa" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">While the Sergeant is on the battlefield, each time a ranged attack targets this unit, if this unit has not made a Normal, Advance, or Fall Back move this turn, worsen the attack&apos;s AP characteristic by 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Thunderous Impact" id="ecea-d188-5950-e1e6" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, if this unit made a Charge move this turn, improve the Strength and Damage characteristics of that attack by 1</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Shroud Bombs" id="1383-9f85-d42b-444e" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Models in this unit cannot be targeted unless the attacking unit is within 18”</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Omni-Scrambler" id="43dd-56ec-9f72-69fd" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Enemy units that are set up on the battlefield from Reserves cannot be set up within 12&quot; of this model.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Reposition Under Covering Fire" id="514d-9ad9-da39-c535" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, if this unit contains a Scout Sergeant, it can make a normal move. If it does so, until the end of the turn, this unit is not eligible to declare a charge.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Fire Discipline" id="7ed7-d7b0-1a8b-ad7b" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time this unit Remains Stationary, if it includes a Support Sergeant or Heavy Support Sergeant, you can select one enemy unit that is visible to that model. Until the end of the turn, each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack that targets that enemy unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
