    <profile name="Personal Teleporter" id="eb64-808e-2e80-9366" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Models in this unit have the Deep Strike keyword</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Unyielding Tenacity" id="f1cb-ed71-4386-42e0" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time an attack targets this unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of this unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Machinator Array" id="5e2a-6fc7-6f71-655a" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Command phase, you can select one friendly Adeptus Astartes Vehicle model within 3&quot; of this model. That model regains up to D3 lost wounds and, until the start of your next Command phase, each time that Vehicle model makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. Each model can only be selected for this ability once per turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Narthecium" id="6a21-e2ae-3f7e-1150" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Command Phase, this unit heals D3+1 Wounds</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Litany of Hate" id="5c62-6e49-9f8a-3c0a" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit gain Lance</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Reclusiam Detachment" id="e833-2f00-ed06-6621" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">During the Declare Battle Formations step, each model in the Reclusiam Delegation must be assigned as a Support model to a unit. Interrogator-Chaplain and Votary models must join a unit. If an Interrogator-Chaplain or Votary model cannot join a unit, that model does not take part in the battle and counts as having been destroyed. 


This model can be attached to the following units:
• Centurion Command List</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Techmarine Detahcment" id="890f-de76-0982-1fdd" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">During the Declare Battle Formations step, each model in the Techmarine Covenant must be assigned as a Support model to a unit. Apothecary models must join a unit. If an Apothecary model cannot join a unit, that model does not take part in the battle and counts as having been destroyed. 


This model can be attached to the following units:
• Centurion Command List</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Apothecarion Detachment" id="8aac-d13b-dfb9-0862" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">During the Declare Battle Formations step, each model in the Apothecary Cadre must be assigned as a Support model to a unit. Apothecary models must join a unit. If an Apothecary model cannot join a unit, that model does not take part in the battle and counts as having been destroyed.


This model can be attached to the following units:
• Centurion Command List</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Librarius Detachment" id="ad63-b069-a154-72d6" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">During the Declare Battle Formations step, each model in the Librarius Conclave must be assigned as a Support model to a unit. Epistolary and Codicier models must join a unit. If an Epistolary or Codicier model cannot join a unit, that model does not take part in the battle and counts as having been destroyed. 


This model can be attached to the following units:
• Centurion Command List</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Psychic Hood (Epistolary Only)" id="cd90-027b-5ba9-2b63" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">While this model is leading a unit, models in that unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against Psychic Attacks.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
