    <profile name="Combat Disembarkation" id="c967-55a7-6875-f807" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time a unit disembarks from this model after it has been set up on the battlefield, that unit is still eligible to declare a charge this turn</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Deployment Complete" id="61b2-a8a0-80a6-d40f" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Once this unit is set up on the battlefield and all units within it have disembarked, until the end of the battle, units cannot embark within this Transport</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Drop Pod Assault" id="0515-f30c-b171-9ab3" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">This unit must start the battle in Reserves and can be set up in the Reinforcements step of your first, second or third Movement phase, regardless of any mission rules. Each drop pod is treated as a separate unit and is deployed individually. Any units embarked within this model must immediately disembark after it has been set up on the battlefield, and they must be set up more than 8&quot; away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Firing Deck 2" id="dc21-4ca3-e500-e7f3" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">his ability always takes the form Firing Deck X. In your Shooting phase, each time this Transport is selected to shoot, if one or more units are embarked within it, resolve the following sequence:


1. Select up to X models embarked within this Transport (excluding models whose units have already been selected to shoot this phase).
2. For each selected model, select one of its ranged weapons (excluding [ONE SHOT] weapons).
3. Until this TRANSPORT has resolved all of its attacks, it has all of those selected weapons in addition to its other weapons.
4. Until the end of the turn, units embarked within this TRANSPORT are not eligible to shoot.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Drop Pod Transport" id="e46a-2041-3467-fd1c" hidden="false" typeId="9e43-915b-56bd-8ac5" typeName="Transport">
      <comment>Drop Pod</comment>
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="b931-c943-fd09-3728">This model has a Transport Capacity of 12. This model cannot transport models with a Bulky (X) of 8+. If this model transports a model with a Bulky (X) rule of 4+, it can only transport that model.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Talonstrike" id="b5ea-0823-a980-16f6" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">A Dreadnought Talon of 3 models or less can be embarked in within Drop Pods, but must be embarked within the same Drop Pod Squadron, and must disembark from their drop pods within coherency.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Deadly Demise D3" id="9ade-009b-4456-16d7" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Some models have &apos;Deadly Demise x&apos; listed in their abilities. When such a model is destroyed, roll one D6 before removing it from play (if such a model is a TRANSPORT, roll before any embarked models disembark). On a 6, each unit within 6&quot; of that model suffers a number of mortal wounds denoted by &apos;x&apos; (if this is a random number, roll separately for each unit within 6&quot;).</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Damaged 4" id="40bd-a2d4-c645-84aa" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">While this model has 1-4 wounds remaining, each time this model makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Armored Hull" id="bb32-d42e-f80f-e006" hidden="false" typeId="3287-3735-752a-4304" typeName="Melee Weapons">
      <comment>Rhino/Arquitor</comment>
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="914c-b413-91e3-a132">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="A" typeId="2337-daa1-6682-b110">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="WS" typeId="95d1-95f-45b4-11d6">4+</characteristic>
