      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">At the start of a Psyker model’s Command Phase where that Psyker is within 6” of this model, or after a Psyker finishes a move that ends within 6” of this model, that Psyker immediately suffers the following penalties:
