    <profile name="Ensnared" id="981f-df96-9a0a-450e" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, if one or more of those attacks made with its Snare Gun scored a hit against an enemy Infantry unit, until the start of your next Shooting phase, that unit is ensnared. While a unit is shaken, subtract 1&quot; from its Move characteristic and subtract 1 from Charge rolls made for it. If the attack was instead made with a Snare Cannon subtract 2” from its Move and 2” from Charge rolls</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Chamber of Judgement" id="c33c-a33b-6fe4-43e9" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Weapons equipped by models in this unit have Precision while targeting Psyker units.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Spectra Cloak" id="40df-79e8-50ec-2ca7" hidden="false" typeId="a8b2-cae8-0cb2-0c83" typeName="Equipment">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a model in this unit makes a shooting attack, this does not remove the Hidden condition from this unit.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Oblivion Knights" id="7ead-16e8-91b3-2ada" hidden="false" typeId="b139-9a8a-94a3-bdc7" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll. If that attack targeted an enemy Psyker unit, improve the AP Characteristic by 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
