          <rules>
            <rule name="Last Flight" id="9bbf-e6ae-f04d-552b" hidden="false">
              <description>• Each time a Destroyers model in your army is destroyed by a melee attack, before removing it from play, roll one D6. On a 5+, the attacking unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
• Destroyer models lose Expendable.</description>
