            <cost name="Crusade: Weapon Modifications" typeId="716d-91b7-d55a-1022" value="0"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Target Designations" id="0f0c-d0bd-7fb0-52bc" hidden="false">
              <description>Adeptus Astartes models with the Scout keyword gain the following ability.
• In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. Choose one of the following Protocols. Until the start of your next turn, each time a friendly unit with this ability makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, they gain the selected benefit. An enemy unit may have any number of Protocols applied; however duplicate Protocols have no effect.
     o Guided Fire: +1 to Hit
     o Armor Analysis: +1 S
     o Weak Pointed Identified: Improve the AP of attacks by 1.
     o Critical Vulnerability: +1 D
     o Close-Quarters-Combat: Rapid Fire 1</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
