                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Adeptus Astartes model only
Once per battle round, when a friendly Adeptus Astartes unit within 6&quot; of the bearer is destroyed, before removing the last model in that unit, you may select another friendly Adeptus Astartes unit within 6&quot; of the bearer. Until the end of the battle round, that unit cannot be selected as the target of a Stratagem used by your opponent.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
