                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6468-b66d-4509-c7d6">Centurion model only
While the bearer is on the battlefield, each time a Adeptus Astartes unit from your army is selected to shoot or fight, if that unit is within 6&quot; of the bearer, it can ignore any or all modifiers to its Leadership characteristic and Battle-shock tests.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
